// Writer 3, batch 2. The newlyweds (facts.md 5): Bea Silva, Marta Soto, Petra Jovanovic and Lukas Dlamini, married
// just before the tour to people back home (they / them, unnamed). They compare their day counts at breakfast. Silva,
// Soto and Jovanovic count up from the wedding; Lukas counts down, the days until home (his card). Nothing beyond
// "I miss them" and the count. Speakers by who: (A) and with: (B), dialogue 0.43.8.

